    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Danger Traps 2</strong> is a <strong>free</strong> hardcore platformer with multiplayer, where every move matters. Dodge deadly traps, find the shortest route to the finish line, and compete for the best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes, fire, guillotines, collapsing platforms \u2014 there's no room for mistakes. Only quick reflexes, precision, and clever thinking will get you to the top of the leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea9 FEATURES \ud83d\udea9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Free to play</strong> \u2013 jump in and start playing without limitations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Deadly traps</strong> \u2013 every level is a dangerous maze filled with fire walls, spikes, moving platforms, collapsing bridges, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Ghost multiplayer</strong> \u2013 see other players running alongside you in real-time, but their actions won't interfere with yours. Who will finish first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 beat the clock and climb the <strong>Steam leaderboards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Multiple paths to victory</strong> \u2013 find the <strong>shortest route</strong> and discover hidden shortcuts to set new records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Over 30 levels</strong> \u2013 each with unique designs, mechanics, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Skins and customization</strong> \u2013 change your character's look and stand out from the crowd!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Frequent updates</strong> \u2013 new levels, mechanics, skins, and improvements are added regularly to keep the game fresh and exciting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea9 <strong>Single-player &amp; multiplayer modes</strong> \u2013 practice offline or compete with others online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562000/extras/4d35bbb2e296c98845868ab71d6916e4.poster.avif?t=1750899359\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562000/extras/4d35bbb2e296c98845868ab71d6916e4.webm?t=1750899359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562000/extras/4d35bbb2e296c98845868ab71d6916e4.mp4?t=1750899359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Can you conquer all the traps and find the fastest path to victory?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your wishlist and get ready for deadly challenges! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
